      "id": "claim_c1dc0df0b35e4d7ab06b913645bcd449",
      "statement": "The frontend is a vanilla JavaScript single-page app whose shell Index.html composes partials via Apps Script include() scriptlets; the entry point must render it with HtmlService.createTemplateFromFile(...).evaluate() because createHtmlOutputFromFile silently fails to expand the scriptlets, and include() returns HtmlService.createHtmlOutputFromFile(filename).getContent().",
