    {
      "id": "claim_41cc2a2f66324b9b863165d1f826fcd6",
      "statement": "All client<->server communication uses only google.script.run.withSuccessHandler(fn).withFailureHandler(fn).serverFunction(args); there is no fetch or REST endpoint, and the backend is addressed by server-side function name. The app runs as the deploying user with domain-wide access and end-user identity is inferred server-side from Session.getActiveUser().getEmail(), never passed by the client.",
