      "id": "claim_fdf3dbf799934f04a54f607331b8b6d3",
      "statement": "Email, letter, and analytics side-effects are best-effort and must never block or roll back a user action: every write handler writes the business state to Sheets first, then runs best-effort generateLetter (wrapped in try/catch, may throw), sendActionConfirmation (never throws), patchAuditEventData, and trackFeatureAction, and still returns { success: true } once the sheet writes succeed regardless of side-effect failures.",
